        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define spot rates and periods\n    spot_rate_2_year = 0.025\n    spot_rate_4_year = 0.055\n    period_2_year = 2\n    period_4_year = 4\n\n    # Calculate the two-year forward rate starting two years from now\n    forward_rate = (\n        ((1 + spot_rate_4_year) ** period_4_year)\n        / ((1 + spot_rate_2_year) ** period_2_year)\n    ) ** (1 / (period_4_year - period_2_year)) - 1\n\n    # Return the rate as a percentage, rounded to three decimal places\n    return round(forward_rate * 100, 3)\n```",
